function makeFromRecord(r,parent){const groupTypes=['Node3D','SceneGroup','StaticBody3D','RigidBody3D','CharacterBody3D','Camera3D','DirectionalLight3D','OmniLight3D','SpotLight3D'];let node;if(groupTypes.includes(r.type)){node=new THREE.Group();if(r.type==='Camera3D'){const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(50,1,.1,100);camera.name='Camera';camera.userData.helper=true;node.add(camera);addNodeMarker(node,0xffcf66);}else if(r.type.includes('Light3D')){const light=r.type==='DirectionalLight3D'?new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffedcf,2):r.type==='SpotLight3D'?new THREE.SpotLight(0xffedcf,35,20,Math.PI/6):new THREE.PointLight(0xffedcf,18,20);light.userData.helper=true;node.add(light);addNodeMarker(node,0xffdf79);}else if(['StaticBody3D','RigidBody3D','CharacterBody3D'].includes(r.type)){const m=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,1,1),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0x6fa8ff,wireframe:true,transparent:true,opacity:.45}));m.userData.helper=true;m.raycast=()=>{};node.add(m);}}else{const geometry=r.type==='Sphere'||r.type==='SphereMesh'?new THREE.SphereGeometry(.6,20,14):r.type==='Capsule'||r.type==='CapsuleMesh'?new THREE.CapsuleGeometry(.35,.8,5,10):r.type==='CylinderMesh'?new THREE.CylinderGeometry(.5,.5,1,20):r.type==='Plane'||r.type==='PlaneMesh'?new THREE.PlaneGeometry(r.type==='Plane'?80:2,r.type==='Plane'?80:2):new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,1,1);node=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:r.color??0x6ee5cc,roughness:.65}));node.castShadow=true;node.receiveShadow=true;}node.name=r.name;node.userData.nodeType=r.type;node.position.fromArray(r.position||[0,0,0]);node.rotation.fromArray(r.rotation||[0,0,0]);node.scale.fromArray(r.scale||[1,1,1]);if(r.script)node.userData.scriptText=r.script;if(r.shader)node.userData.shaderCode=r.shader;if(r.vertex)node.userData.vertexShader=r.vertex;parent.add(node);data.objects.push(node);if(r.image)applyImageData(r.image,node).catch(()=>{});if(r.shader||r.vertex)applyShader(node);return node;}
function addNodeMarker(node,color){const marker=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(.14,10,8),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color}));marker.userData.helper=true;marker.raycast=()=>{};node.add(marker);}
